  "description": "Add a playful and festive touch to your holiday projects with this Whimsical Christmas Cocktail Clipart Bundle! This charming collection features adorable illustrated Christmas drinks, including a cute golden cocktail with a smiling face, a gingerbread cookie decoration, a festive red cocktail glass, sparkling ice cubes, cinnamon sticks, star anise, cranberries, and fresh evergreen branches.\nDesigned with rich holiday colors, glossy drink details, and whimsical watercolor-inspired artwork, these illustrations are perfect for creating unique Christmas designs with a fun seasonal cocktail theme. The combination of warm golden tones, vibrant reds, snowy white accents, and natural greenery makes this collection ideal for holiday celebrations and winter-themed creative projects.\nUse these festive cocktail illustrations for Christmas party invitations, holiday menus, cocktail recipe cards, greeting cards, printable decorations, stickers, scrapbooking, gift tags, sublimation projects, apparel designs, mugs, and other seasonal crafts.\n**Product Details:**\n– Included: 34 PNG files\n– Resolution: 300 DPI\n– Background: Transparent\n– Theme: Christmas Cocktails, Holiday Drinks, Gingerbread, Festive Beverages, Winter Holidays\n– Style: Whimsical Illustration, Cute Character Art, Watercolor-Inspired Clipart\n– Colors: Festive Red, Golden Amber, White, Green, and Silver\nBring holiday cheer to your creative projects with these adorable Christmas cocktail illustrations, perfect for adding a playful and festive atmosphere to your seasonal designs.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Add a playful and festive touch to your holiday projects with this Whimsical Christmas Cocktail Clipart Bundle! This charming collection features adorable illustrated Christmas drinks, including a cute golden cocktail with a smiling face, a gingerbread cookie decoration, a festive red cocktail glass, sparkling ice cubes, cinnamon sticks, star anise, cranberries, and fresh evergreen branches.</p>\n<p>Designed with rich holiday colors, glossy drink details, and whimsical watercolor-inspired artwork, these illustrations are perfect for creating unique Christmas designs with a fun seasonal cocktail theme. The combination of warm golden tones, vibrant reds, snowy white accents, and natural greenery makes this collection ideal for holiday celebrations and winter-themed creative projects.</p>\n<p>Use these festive cocktail illustrations for Christmas party invitations, holiday menus, cocktail recipe cards, greeting cards, printable decorations, stickers, scrapbooking, gift tags, sublimation projects, apparel designs, mugs, and other seasonal crafts.</p>\n<p>**Product Details:**<br>\n– Included: 34 PNG files<br>\n– Resolution: 300 DPI<br>\n– Background: Transparent<br>\n– Theme: Christmas Cocktails, Holiday Drinks, Gingerbread, Festive Beverages, Winter Holidays<br>\n– Style: Whimsical Illustration, Cute Character Art, Watercolor-Inspired Clipart<br>\n– Colors: Festive Red, Golden Amber, White, Green, and Silver</p>\n<p>Bring holiday cheer to your creative projects with these adorable Christmas cocktail illustrations, perfect for adding a playful and festive atmosphere to your seasonal designs.</p>",
